From 91a2df581e4bbe41e5cdef26d3d820eb66794f52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 04:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] wine: the Windows user is ArtCraft; Mihawk and steamuser
 profiles move to it

Every prefix's Windows user was Mihawk (patch 1240's GetUserNameA/W, the
title's user folders, wine/ps5/pw_wine_compat.c's passwd), so Start's account
row, C:\users and every Documents path said Mihawk. The ArtCraft edition's
user is ArtCraft.

A prefix made before keeps its saves in C:\users\Mihawk (MihawkOS v3, whose
marker names Mihawk) or C:\users\steamuser (v2.0.0-alpha-1 and -2), so the
title's one-time move (src/pw_wine_profile.h) now takes a list of former
profiles, newest first, and moves each into users/ArtCraft by the same four
repeatable steps:
  - each former folder merges into ArtCraft (one rename, or name by name);
  - each gone former name becomes a link line to ArtCraft, and a line an
    earlier move wrote (steamuser -> Mihawk) is pointed straight at
    ArtCraft, so no link leads to another;
  - the registry's references to either name become ArtCraft. ArtCraft is
    longer than Mihawk, so pw_wine_profile_rewrite now writes into a buffer
    of pw_wine_profile_rewrite_room(length) bytes instead of in place;
  - the marker names ArtCraft last; one naming Mihawk is moved again.
HKCU\Software\Mihawk and \MihawkOS keys, and names that only look alike
(users\MihawkOS, users\Mihawks, C:\Mihawk), are kept. A new prefix (the
ArtCraft desktop's) is ArtCraft's from the start. tools/stage-wine.py's PC
template prefix follows.

Proven on the host (gcc 13, -Wall -Wextra -Werror, ASan and UBSan):
tests/test_pw_wine_profile.c passes with its alpha-2 cases retargeted at
ArtCraft and new ones for a whole MihawkOS v3 prefix (folder moved, saves
kept, steamuser -> Mihawk repointed and Mihawk linked, 9 references
rewritten, the second start a no-op), growing text and the worst-case room;
tests/test_pw_wine_launch.c (users/ArtCraft folders) and
tests/test_pw_wine_prefix.c pass. tools/host-tests.sh itself needs
../PS5_Vulkan, not in this checkout. No console run.

